{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"元年春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"仲孫蔑會晉欒黶、宋華元、衛甯殖、曹人、莒人、邾人、滕人、薛人圍宋彭城。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"夏，晉韓厥帥師伐鄭。仲孫蔑會齊崔杼、曹人、邾人、杞人次于鄫。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"秋，楚公子壬夫帥師侵宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"九月辛酉，天王崩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"邾子來朝。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"冬，衛侯使公孫剽來聘。晉侯使荀罃來聘。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"元年春己亥，圍宋彭城。非宋地，追書也。于是為宋討魚石，故稱宋，且不登叛人也，謂之宋志。彭城降晉，晉人以宋五大夫在彭城者歸，寘諸瓠丘。齊人不會彭城，晉人以為討。二月，齊大子光為質于晉。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"夏五月，晉韓厥、荀偃帥諸侯之師伐鄭，入其郛，敗其徒兵于洧上。于是東諸侯之師次于鄫，以待晉師。晉師自鄭以鄫之師侵楚焦、夷及陳。晉侯、衛侯次于戚，以為之援。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_12","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"秋，楚子辛救鄭，侵宋呂、留。鄭子然侵宋，取犬丘。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_13","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"九月，邾子來朝，禮也。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_ttr_151_14","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_151","textTraditional":"冬，衛子叔、晉知武子來聘，禮也。凡諸侯即位，小國朝之，大國聘焉，以繼好、結信、謀事、補闕，禮之大者也。","sentenceOrder":14}],"overrides":{}}